down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 as a SEV2 on payments-worker, and on-call has been paged.\n\n**Still open:** right after the rollback, payments-api was still unhealthy at 18% errors on v5.1.0. It may just need time to recover. But payments-api v5.1.0 was also a new release, and its last healthy version is v5.0.0, so the problem may be in that release too. I haven't touched payments-api. If it doesn't recover soon, I can roll it back to v5.0.0 if you want.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SsvkhnusVWa4rDPyVd3KYP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012e4S9LfgDeTSnAjuFV7Xku", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01DGApLEWAbTz2eLJPeN2jR6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015Mejn2hPaVo4n3M7onw9Je", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EQWjVFF4ZwKiAj5iTF6Srh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014C21HCQ2yhjdojcD5yDSm8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016sBZ8KRxMyein3qq6yhA7b", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01